c-shiji-113-nanyue","book_id":"b-shiji-113","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p004","text":"至建元六年，閩越擊南越。南越守天子約，不敢擅發兵擊而以聞。上遣大行王恢出豫章，大農韓安國出會稽，皆為將軍。兵未踰嶺，閩越王郢發兵距險。其弟餘善乃與相、宗族謀曰：「王以擅發兵擊南越，不請，故天子兵來誅。今漢兵眾彊，今即幸勝之，后來益多，終滅國而止。今殺王以謝天子。天子聽，罷兵，固一國完；不聽，乃力戰；不勝，即亡入海。」皆曰「善」。即鏦殺王，使使奉其頭致大行。大行曰：「所為來者誅王。今王頭至，謝罪，不戰而耘，利莫大焉。」乃以便宜案兵告大農軍，而使使奉王頭馳報天子。詔罷兩將兵，曰：「郢等首惡，獨無諸孫繇君丑不與謀焉。」乃使郎中將立丑為越繇王，奉閩越先祭祀。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"y1h_fo3_brs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"4gs_22r_d9a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person","person_id":"oj7_6jw_4hs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"宗族","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"y1h_fo3_brs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"y1h_fo3_brs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"y1h_fo3_brs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0229","start":229,"end":231,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"y1h_fo3_brs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0241","start":241,"end":242,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0247","start":247,"end":249,"surface":"無諸","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0252","start":252,"end":253,"surface":"丑","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0261","start":261,"end":264,"surface":"郎中將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0265","start":265,"end":266,"surface":"丑","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","book_id":"b-shiji-114","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p005","text":"餘善已殺郢，威行於國，國民多屬，竊自立為王。繇王不能矯其眾持正。天子聞之，為餘善不足復興師，曰：「餘善數與郢謀亂，而後首誅郢，師得不勞。」因立餘善為東越王，與繇王并處。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"繇王","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"y1h_fo3_brs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m005-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"繇王","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","book_id":"b-shiji-114","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:p003","text":"建元六年，大行王恢擊東越，東越殺王郢以報。恢因兵威使番陽令唐蒙風指曉南越。南越食蒙蜀枸醬，蒙問所從來，曰「道西北牂柯，牂柯江廣數里，出番禺城下」。蒙歸至長安，問蜀賈人，賈人曰：「獨蜀出枸醬，多持竊出市夜郎。夜郎者，臨牂柯江，江廣百餘步，足以行船。南越以財物役屬夜郎，西至同師，然亦不能臣使也。」蒙乃上書說上曰：「南越王黃屋左纛，地東西萬餘里，名為外臣，實一州主也。今以長沙、豫章往，水道多絕，難行。竊聞夜郎所有精兵，可得十餘萬，浮船牂柯江，出其不意，此制越一奇也。誠以漢之彊，巴蜀之饒，通夜郎道，為置吏，易甚。」上許之。乃拜蒙為郎中將，將千人，食重萬餘人，從巴蜀筰關入，遂見夜郎侯多同。蒙厚賜，喻以威德，約為置吏，使其子為令。夜郎旁小邑皆貪漢繒帛，以為漢道險，終不能有也，乃且聽蒙約。還報，乃以為犍為郡。發巴蜀卒治道，自僰道指牂柯江。蜀人司馬相如亦言西夷邛、筰可置郡。使相如以郎中將往喻，皆如南夷，為置一都尉，十餘縣，屬蜀。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m003-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"4gs_22r_d9a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m003-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m003-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"恢","kind":"person","person_id":"4gs_22r_d9a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m003-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"唐蒙","kind":"person","person_id":"a62_lwv_9ui","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m003-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"蒙","ki